Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["SM 4-point diagram tests", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"f5388bae-ba32-4532-88a0-c03f8c53a28a"],

Cell["\<\
Compares CreateDiagrams (new tree generator) to the hardcoded 4-point \
amplitudes copied from SM-4-point.nb.

Each (process, mediator) is compared up to one overall sign. Relative S/T/U \
signs for that mediator must match (identical-fermion exchange minus is \
included in the generator).

Gluon diagrams are generated but not compared (the templates are \
colour-stripped EW amplitudes).

Current status of the 4-fermion battery:
  - Higgs S and S+T: pass, including the Fermi minus on same-flavour T-channel.
  - Photon and gluon S and S+T: pass up to an overall minus.
  - Z S and S+T: pass (ReduceSpinContractions, then T/U momentum rewrite).
  - W T (uUDd) and W S (uDTb): pass; do not replace MW -> MZ CW on W.
  - ff -> A.+ h T (e, u, d): pass; each channel equals the combined template.
  - ff -> A.+ A.- (e, u, d): pass; T+U sum equals the combined template.
  - ff -> W- W+ photon S (e, u, d): pass; two-helicity sum.
  - A.+ / G.+ f -> Z F S (e, u, d): pass; S equals the combined template.
  - h G.+ -> F f T (u, d): pass; T equals the combined template.
  - G.+ f -> A.+ / G.+ F (u, d): pass; S+U sum equals the combined template.
  - G.+ f -> A.- F: pass; S+U sum equals the combined template.
  - A.+ W+ -> Ne e S and U: pass; each equals the combined template.
  - G.+ W+ -> U d T and U: pass; each equals the combined template.
  - A.+ W+ -> U d: pass; S+T+U average of two Xi replacements (SumAll).
  - E ne -> A.+ W- S and T: pass; each equals the combined template.
  - E ne -> Z W- S, T, and U: pass; each equals its channel template.
  - U d -> Z W+ S, T, and U: pass; each equals its channel template.
  - Extra 2-fermion-2-boson processes are in otherTests.
  - Four-boson: hhZZ / hhWW contact, A.+ h -> WW T, Z h -> WW S/T/U, \
and A.+ A.+ / A.+ A.- -> WW T+U and A.+ Z -> WW U pass.
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"682eccd7-dd60-4a03-87e6-8e3745b80c87"],

